title: "DRE SEO: search-engine optimisation, structured data and citation metadata for Omeka S"
abstract: >-
  An Omeka S module that adds the discovery layer the platform does not ship with.
  It injects per-page meta descriptions, Open Graph and Twitter cards, canonical
  links and schema.org JSON-LD — set by hand for static site pages, derived
  automatically for every resource page from its metadata and resource template.
  It emits Highwire Press and Dublin Core citation tags so the Zotero Connector,
  Google Scholar and other reference managers capture each record as a correctly
  typed reference, formats Chicago, APA and MLA citations on the record page, and
  serves BibTeX, RIS and CSL-JSON downloads. It also serves an XML sitemap index
  with per-type children, a robots.txt, a Google Search Console verification tag,
  and an optional IndexNow ping when public content changes. Built for the Africa
  Multiple Cluster of Excellence Digital Research Environment.
